Chapter: RecordKeywordField
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 Minimal reproduction: using a reserved keyword as a record field
 name. The hypothesis is that is-record-keyword crashes (GPF)
 when it encounters a token that IS a keyword being used as a
 field name in a record literal.

 We say:

Section: Record with keyword-named field

  TestRec = record {
    name : Text,
    effect : Integer,
    value : Integer
  }

  make-test : Integer -> TestRec
  make-test (n) = TestRec { name = "hello", effect = n * 2, value = n }

  read-test : TestRec -> Integer
  read-test (r) = r.effect + r.value

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let t = make-test 5
    in print-line-uni (show (read-test t))
  end

